{"id": "3249625", "revid": "322190", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3249625", "title": "Lev Mecinikov", "text": "Lev Ilici Mecinikov (\u00een , \u00een ; ) a fost un geograf, sociolog \u0219i teoretician anarhist rus \u0219i elve\u021bian de origine rom\u00e2n\u0103 \u0219i evreiasc\u0103.&lt;ref name=\"Krugosvet.ru/enc/gumanitarnye_nauki/sociologiya/mechnikov_lev_ilich.html_2025-09-06\"&gt;&lt;/ref&gt;\nBiografie.\nLev Ilici Mecinikov s-a n\u0103scut la 18/30 mai 1838 la Sankt Petersburg, capitala Imperiului Rus. Tat\u0103l s\u0103u provenea dintr-o familie boiereasc\u0103 moldovean\u0103, descendent\u0103 din Nicolae Milescu Sp\u0103tarul, refugiat\u0103 \u00een Rusia \u00eempreun\u0103 cu Dimitrie Cantemir. Mama sa era de origine evreiasc\u0103. Fratele s\u0103u mai mic a fost medicul Ilia Mecinikov, laureat al Premiului Nobel.\nA urmat cursurile mai multor universit\u0103\u021bi din Rusia, unde a studiat diverse discipline, inclusiv limbi str\u0103ine, medicin\u0103, fizic\u0103 \u0219i arte. Datorit\u0103 implic\u0103rii \u00een activismul revolu\u021bionar, a fost suspendat de la cursuri.&lt;ref name=\"Az.lib.ru/m/mechnikow_l_i/text_1999_bio.shtml_2025-09-06\"&gt;&lt;/ref&gt; \u00cen 1860, s-a mutat \u00een Italia, unde a luptat sub comanda lui Giuseppe Garibaldi \u00een timpul Risorgimento-ului. \u00cen 1864, pe c\u00e2nd locuia la Floren\u021ba, i-a cunoscut pe revolu\u021bionarii ru\u0219i Aleksandr Herzen \u0219i Mihail Bakunin. \u00cen acela\u0219i an s-a stabilit \u00een Elve\u021bia, unde a tr\u0103it \u0219i a lucrat timp de zece ani.\n\u00cen ianuarie 1874 s-a mutat \u00een Japonia, unde a activat ca profesor timp de doi ani, dup\u0103 care s-a \u00eentors \u00een Elve\u021bia. Acolo a sus\u021binut cursuri despre Japonia la Universitatea din Geneva \u0219i a publicat, \u00eempreun\u0103 cu Fran\u00e7ois Turrettini, o revist\u0103 dedicat\u0103 Asiei de Est. De asemenea, a colaborat cu geograful \u00c9lis\u00e9e Reclus la \"Nouvelle G\u00e9ographie universelle\", furniz\u00e2nd informa\u021bii geografice despre Japonia \u0219i Rusia. \u00cen 1883 a \u00eenceput s\u0103 predea statistic\u0103 \u0219i geografie comparat\u0103 la Universitatea din Neuch\u00e2tel, unde a fondat \u0219i Societatea Geografic\u0103 local\u0103 \u00een 1885.\n\u00cen aceast\u0103 perioad\u0103, Mecinikov a redactat numeroase lucr\u0103ri de sociologie, geografie \u0219i teorie politic\u0103 anarhist\u0103. \u00cen articolul s\u0103u din 1886, \"Revolu\u021bia \u0219i evolu\u021bia\", a sus\u021binut c\u0103 evolu\u021bia sociocultural\u0103 tinde inexorabil de la despotism c\u0103tre anarhie. \u00cen volumul s\u0103u de sociologie \"Civiliza\u021bia \u0219i marile r\u00e2uri istorice\", publicat postum \u00een 1889, \u0219i-a elaborat concep\u021biile privind originea \u0219i dezvoltarea societ\u0103\u021bii: etapa inferioar\u0103 a civiliza\u021biei implica apari\u021bia organiza\u021biilor publice prin constr\u00e2ngere; etapa de tranzi\u021bie se caracteriza prin diviziunea muncii; iar etapa superioar\u0103 era definit\u0103 de formarea asocia\u021biilor voluntare. Totodat\u0103, el a ar\u0103tat c\u0103 civiliza\u021biile s-au dezvoltat prin rela\u021bia lor cu hidrosfera: de la civiliza\u021biile fluviale din Antichitate, la civiliza\u021biile mediteraneene din Evul Mediu \u0219i p\u00e2n\u0103 la civiliza\u021biile oceanice ale epocii moderne.\nMecinikov s-a \u00eemboln\u0103vit \u00een 1887, ceea ce l-a obligat s\u0103 se retrag\u0103 din activitatea didactic\u0103. A murit la 18/30 iunie 1888 la Clarens, \u00een cantonul Vaud (Elve\u021bia)."}
{"id": "3249629", "revid": "322190", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3249629", "title": "Ananii Zelvianski", "text": "Ananii Samuilovici (\u0218muilovici) Zelvianski (\u00een ; ) a fost un revolu\u021bionar bol\u0219evic de origine rus\u0103, membru al Sovietului Gubernial din Chi\u0219in\u0103u \u0219i, pentru o scurt\u0103 perioad\u0103, deputat \u00een Sfatul \u021a\u0103rii. \nBiografie.\nZelvianski s-a n\u0103scut \u00een ora\u0219ul Nicolaev din gubernia Herson, \u00eentr-o familie evreiasc\u0103.&lt;ref name=\"Archive.memo.ru/%d0%97%d0%95%d0%9b%d0%ac%d0%92%d0%af%d0%9d%d0%a1%d0%9a%d0%98%d0%99-%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%98%d0%99-%d0%a1%d0%90%d0%9c%d0%9e%d0%99%d0%9b%d0%9e%d0%92%d0%98%d0%a7-%d0%9f%d0%90%d0%a0%d0%a2-%d0%9a%d0%9b%d0%98%d0%a7%d0%9a%d0%90-%d0%9f%d0%a1%d0%a0-%d0%af%d0%a8%d0%90-%d0%9a%d0%9e%d0%9c%d0%95%d0%a0%d0%a1%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%a2-%d0%a5%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%98%d0%99-%d0%a8%d0%9c%d0%a3%d0%99%d0%9b%d0%9e%d0%92%d0%98%d0%a7-1886-30-12-1943-,-id:-ru12707902-pers-64390?sf_culture=ru_2025-09-06\"&gt;&lt;/ref&gt;\nBasarabia \u0219i activitatea revolu\u021bionar\u0103.\nDup\u0103 revolu\u021bia din Februarie, a participat la organizarea forma\u021biunilor bol\u0219evice din Gubernia Basarabia, ajung\u00e2nd s\u0103 fac\u0103 parte din Sovietul Gubernial din Chi\u0219in\u0103u.&lt;ref name=\"R\u0102ZBOIUL PENTRU TRECUT / \u0412\u041e\u0419\u041d\u0410 \u0417\u0410 \u041f\u0420\u041e\u0428\u041b\u041e\u0415_2019-01-23\"&gt;&lt;/ref&gt; Dup\u0103 proclamarea Republicii Moldovene\u0219ti, forma\u021biunile militare bol\u0219evice \u0219i sovietele locale \u0219i-au trimis reprezentan\u021bii \u00een parlamentul local, Sfatul \u021a\u0103rii.&lt;ref name=\"Academia.edu/45499591/sfatul_tarii_istoria_zbuciumat%c4%83_a_unei_importante_institu%c8%9bii_politice_basarabene_2025-08-28\"&gt;&lt;/ref&gt; Printre ei s-a aflat \u0219i Ananii Zelvianski.&lt;ref name=\"Academia.edu/45499591/sfatul_tarii_istoria_zbuciumat%c4%83_a_unei_importante_institu%c8%9bii_politice_basarabene_2025-08-28\"&gt;&lt;/ref&gt; Dup\u0103 interven\u021bia Armatei Rom\u00e2ne \u00een Basarabia, a trecut Nistrul \u0219i a devenit comisar \u00eens\u0103rcinat cu investigarea cazurilor \u00een zona de front a Districtului Militar Odesa, fiind cunoscut sub numele Ia\u0219a Komersant. Dup\u0103 ce este \u00eencercuit de Armata Alb\u0103, reu\u0219e\u0219te s\u0103 fug\u0103 la Harbin, \u00een Manciuria.&lt;ref name=\"Archive.memo.ru/%d0%97%d0%95%d0%9b%d0%ac%d0%92%d0%af%d0%9d%d0%a1%d0%9a%d0%98%d0%99-%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%98%d0%99-%d0%a1%d0%90%d0%9c%d0%9e%d0%99%d0%9b%d0%9e%d0%92%d0%98%d0%a7-%d0%9f%d0%90%d0%a0%d0%a2-%d0%9a%d0%9b%d0%98%d0%a7%d0%9a%d0%90-%d0%9f%d0%a1%d0%a0-%d0%af%d0%a8%d0%90-%d0%9a%d0%9e%d0%9c%d0%95%d0%a0%d0%a1%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%a2-%d0%a5%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%98%d0%99-%d0%a8%d0%9c%d0%a3%d0%99%d0%9b%d0%9e%d0%92%d0%98%d0%a7-1886-30-12-1943-,-id:-ru12707902-pers-64390?sf_culture=ru_2025-09-06\"&gt;&lt;/ref&gt;\nVia\u021ba ulterioar\u0103 \u0219i represiunea.\nP\u00e2n\u0103 \u00een 1935, a lucrat la Calea Ferat\u0103 Chinez\u0103 de Est. \u00centors \u00een URSS, s-a angajat la gara Saratov-2 ca \"lichidator de m\u0103rfuri\", primind \u0219i pensie de revolu\u021bionar.&lt;ref name=\"Archive.memo.ru/%d0%97%d0%95%d0%9b%d0%ac%d0%92%d0%af%d0%9d%d0%a1%d0%9a%d0%98%d0%99-%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%98%d0%99-%d0%a1%d0%90%d0%9c%d0%9e%d0%99%d0%9b%d0%9e%d0%92%d0%98%d0%a7-%d0%9f%d0%90%d0%a0%d0%a2-%d0%9a%d0%9b%d0%98%d0%a7%d0%9a%d0%90-%d0%9f%d0%a1%d0%a0-%d0%af%d0%a8%d0%90-%d0%9a%d0%9e%d0%9c%d0%95%d0%a0%d0%a1%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%a2-%d0%a5%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%98%d0%99-%d0%a8%d0%9c%d0%a3%d0%99%d0%9b%d0%9e%d0%92%d0%98%d0%a7-1886-30-12-1943-,-id:-ru12707902-pers-64390?sf_culture=ru_2025-09-06\"&gt;&lt;/ref&gt;\n\u00cen 1937, \u00een timpul Marii Terori, este arestat de NKVD \u0219i condamnat de procuratura URSS.&lt;ref name=\"Timenote.info/en/ananij-zelvjanskij_2025-09-06\"&gt;&lt;/ref&gt; A fost executat prin \u00eempu\u0219care pe 29 septembrie 1937&lt;ref name=\"Timenote.info/en/ananij-zelvjanskij_2025-09-06\"&gt;&lt;/ref&gt; (\u00een arhivele NKVD decesul e consemnat pe data de 30 decembrie 1943).&lt;ref name=\"Archive.memo.ru/%d0%97%d0%95%d0%9b%d0%ac%d0%92%d0%af%d0%9d%d0%a1%d0%9a%d0%98%d0%99-%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%98%d0%99-%d0%a1%d0%90%d0%9c%d0%9e%d0%99%d0%9b%d0%9e%d0%92%d0%98%d0%a7-%d0%9f%d0%90%d0%a0%d0%a2-%d0%9a%d0%9b%d0%98%d0%a7%d0%9a%d0%90-%d0%9f%d0%a1%d0%a0-%d0%af%d0%a8%d0%90-%d0%9a%d0%9e%d0%9c%d0%95%d0%a0%d0%a1%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%a2-%d0%a5%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%90%d0%9d%d0%98%d0%99-%d0%a8%d0%9c%d0%a3%d0%99%d0%9b%d0%9e%d0%92%d0%98%d0%a7-1886-30-12-1943-,-id:-ru12707902-pers-64390?sf_culture=ru_2025-09-06\"&gt;&lt;/ref&gt;\nA fost reabilitat post-mortem de 17 septembrie 1957, de c\u0103tre tribunalul militar din Kiev.&lt;ref name=\"Timenote.info/en/ananij-zelvjanskij_2025-09-06\"&gt;&lt;/ref&gt;"}
